#N canvas 30 30 1900 1200 input 0;
#X text 20 20 Every button: the 8x8 grid as notes r*10+c \, row 1 at the bottom \, and the outer ring as CC. Two decodes \, one emit chain., f 58;
#X text 700 20 The gate is one channel: in Programmer Mode everything arrives on the device's own channel 1 \, so the Pd channel must equal the block., f 58;
