#X text 20 20 Polyphonic aftertouch has to be enabled on the device. Its default \, Channel Pressure \, looks like a working decode reporting the wrong pad (Reference \, Aftertouch is a device setting)., f 58;
#X text 700 20 polytouchin fires its note before its value (item 86) \, so the note goes to a cold store and the value triggers., f 58;
