#N canvas 40 40 2600 1500 watchdog 0;
#X text 20 20 The replug watchdog. A replugged Launchpad comes back in Live Mode while this file still owns it \, and the Mac and the device fail differently \, so there are two mechanisms., f 110;
#X text 20 160 Mac: the device answers the inquiry in either mode \, so the poll cannot see a replug \, and the heartbeat re-asserts Programmer Mode every tick instead. Device: the replug drops the ALSA subscriptions \, the poll sees the loss \, and u_present re-wires., f 110;
#X text 1450 900 The arming gate: ownership drops only once a reply has been seen \, so a detector that never worked cannot blank the grid. It gates the drop and nothing else (item 235)., f 78;
#X text 20 1120 The heartbeat rides want \, not own: one SysEx a tick needs no detection \, and on a Mac nothing else works., f 110;
#X obj 20 500 r presence;
#X obj 20 560 route tick;
#X obj 20 640 spigot;
#X obj 260 580 r \$0-want;
