#X text 1000 1120 The second source of liveness: \$0-lp-on \, set by every pad \, ring and pressure event \, so a Launchpad being played stays present. The reject goes nowhere on purpose: notein and ctlin are omni \, and a 0 is evidence about another device., f 62;
