#X text 1000 1240 A held pad or button holds the heartbeat off: re-entering Programmer Mode makes the device let go of everything held \, and a held repeat pad stopped repeating at the next tick (Brendan \, 2026-11-04). \$0-held is 1 for each note \, then 128 + each CC \, that is down. A pad unplugged while held stays held here until it is pressed and let go again \, and on a Mac the heartbeat waits that long., f 70;
